WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.664 --> 00:00:03.246
- [Narrator] The village
of Kamikatsu is special.

00:00:03.246 --> 00:00:06.419
Not for its tea fields
or idyllic mountains

00:00:06.419 --> 00:00:08.685
or peaceful historic homes.

00:00:08.685 --> 00:00:11.181
It's known for something it doesn't have.

00:00:11.181 --> 00:00:15.098
Kamikatsu, as a town,
produces almost no trash.

00:00:20.466 --> 00:00:23.596
Kamikatsu has a population
of roughly 1,500 people

00:00:23.596 --> 00:00:26.731
and in the 1990s was
doing nearly no recycling.

00:00:26.731 --> 00:00:29.648
(foreign language)

00:00:34.709 --> 00:00:37.386
Burning all that garbage
created carbon dioxide omissions

00:00:37.386 --> 00:00:39.452
that became dangerous,
and the nature around them

00:00:39.452 --> 00:00:42.086
was suffering, so a decision was made.

00:00:42.086 --> 00:00:44.705
Kamikatsu had to change.

00:00:44.705 --> 00:00:47.445
This was the start of their
path toward zero waste

00:00:47.445 --> 00:00:49.453
and a new way of living.

00:00:49.453 --> 00:00:52.370
(foreign language)

00:00:57.295 --> 00:00:59.830
Effectively, what zero waste here means

00:00:59.830 --> 00:01:01.342
is that there's no such thing

00:01:01.342 --> 00:01:03.926
as throwing something in the trash.

00:01:03.926 --> 00:01:06.615
Everything has to get recycled.

00:01:06.615 --> 00:01:11.542
And in the beginning, it
was difficult for everyone.

00:01:11.542 --> 00:01:13.495
Like Mr. Takuya Takeichi.

00:01:13.495 --> 00:01:15.928
He's shop owner in Kamikatsu.

00:01:15.928 --> 00:01:18.845
(foreign language)

00:01:30.385 --> 00:01:32.241
And Mrs. Hachie Katayama.

00:01:32.241 --> 00:01:33.741
She's a housewife.

00:01:35.175 --> 00:01:38.092
(foreign language)

00:01:49.610 --> 00:01:52.093
That classification
system she's talking about

00:01:52.093 --> 00:01:56.260
is the key to Kamikatsu's
success, and it is aggressive.

00:01:57.161 --> 00:02:00.150
There are 45 categories of recyclables.

00:02:00.150 --> 00:02:03.067
(foreign language)

00:02:08.495 --> 00:02:12.253
The list, it goes on; there's 35 more.

00:02:12.253 --> 00:02:16.198
Slowly, what was
originally this huge burden

00:02:16.198 --> 00:02:18.935
became a way of life in Kamikatsu.

00:02:18.935 --> 00:02:21.359
People began looking at trash differently.

00:02:21.359 --> 00:02:24.276
(foreign language)

00:02:35.383 --> 00:02:38.300
(foreign language)

00:02:56.479 --> 00:03:00.085
It's important to recognize
that Kamikatsu is a small town.

00:03:00.085 --> 00:03:02.149
It is not like New York or London.

00:03:02.149 --> 00:03:05.575
The rules are not the same,
but there is a constant,

00:03:05.575 --> 00:03:07.502
and that's people; they can change.

00:03:07.502 --> 00:03:10.419
(foreign language)

00:03:25.461 --> 00:03:28.378
(foreign language)

00:03:43.525 --> 00:03:46.525
(foreign language)

